Z||000014||frontal lobe||08-03-2001||01:04 AM||||If you see a maroon '87GT zipping around Brookfield, Milwaukee, or the surrounding suburbs, it might be me.<P>And Winston (FieroLT1), you and all owners of v8 Fieros are my heroes.  I've been tempted to look up your address and just drive by where you live for a GLIMPSE of your car, but I don't want to be one of those Fiero Stalkers, you know?  BTW, I have a '96 Buick Roadmaster LT1 sitting in the garage if you want something to do, and some extra cash!<P>And FIERO JOHN-WI, I've been tempted to come by and see the stretch Fiero that is for sale-not to buy but just to see it.<P>Just curious, how many of you fellow Wisconsin guys drive your Fieros in the winter?||||reg||1
